IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-AUTODIN-CYCLE-RECEIPT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-AUTODIN-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME    PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-LN2-OVER-LNE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-CYCLE-CONTEXT.
   05 D1-CYCLE-N          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-AUTH-SECRET      PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-AUTH-CHI         PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-NONCE-DESCRIPTOR.
   05 D2-CURR-NONCE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-VALIDATION-RCV   PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-EXPECTED-RCV     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD    PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 693 TO D0-LN2-OVER-LNE.
    MOVE 5 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.

    PERFORM COMPUTE-EXPECTED-RECEIPT.
    IF D2-VALIDATION-RCV == D2-EXPECTED-RCV
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

COMPUTE-EXPECTED-RECEIPT.
    comment Modular polynomial receipt evaluation: Expected = (Nonce^3 + Chi) pmod MotzkinPrime;
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-RCV = (D2-CURR-NONCE * D2-CURR-NONCE).
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-RCV = D2-EXPECTED-RCV - ((D2-EXPECTED-RCV / D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME) * D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME).
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-RCV = (D2-EXPECTED-RCV * D2-CURR-NONCE).
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-RCV = D2-EXPECTED-RCV - ((D2-EXPECTED-RCV / D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME) * D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME).
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-RCV = D2-EXPECTED-RCV + D1-AUTH-CHI.
    COMPUTE D2-EXPECTED-RCV = D2-EXPECTED-RCV - ((D2-EXPECTED-RCV / D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME) * D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME).
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-CURR-NONCE - ((D2-CURR-NONCE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
